### 1. CRITICAL: Unprotected Map Access (Lines 42-47, 104, 125, 137, 151-155, 166-173, 182-191)

**The Interleaving of Doom:**
```
Goroutine A: reads c.data[key] (line 42)
Goroutine B: writes c.data[key] = &CacheEntry{...} (line 104)
PANIC: concurrent map read/write
```

**Affected methods:** `Get` fast path, `Set`, `cleanup`, `Size`, `GetStats`, `Refresh`, `LoadOrStore`

### 2. CRITICAL: Stats Race (Lines 45, 52, 70, 73)

